  "description": "CR 603.2 / 701.20e / 701.27a / 712.6d / 111.10b / 602.5d: Sidequest: Catch a Fish looks at its controller's top card each of their upkeeps, offers nothing on a land, makes no Food and stays when a creature is declined, takes an artifact into hand, makes a Food and transforms; Cooking Campsite taps for {W} and, only at sorcery speed, sacrifices an artifact for a +1/+1 counter on each creature its controller controls",
